  arithmetic and coastwise conversion are substantial improvements. The
  displayed width still incorrectly has a positive n_d power of hatBeta; the
  source and its own following logarithm require hatBeta to power -n_d/2.
  Both prose and evidence need correction.

  The origin-budget sum needs Borne.place together with rises: a nonzero
  polynomial has a nonzero coefficient containing a marker, whose named
  origin lies in its support. Mere nonemptiness of the support does not imply
  this. Moreover one bounds the prices of active entries, rather than
  asserting that all chosen envelope budgets sum to the marker budget when
  inactive entries may have nonzero envelopes. The support exponent must be
  nonnegative.

  The small-ball denominator needs the exact positive-radius/action-threshold
  bound, nonnegative beta, lawfulness bounds and pointwise nonnegative
  effective density. The ambient Haar-ball packing estimate has not yet been
  proved or cited in the manuscript; Gauge.Size supplies a short elementary
  proof. The backward transfer should explicitly preserve integrability and
  integrals through transition_mass, commute finite coefficient maps with the
  integral, and identify the effective partition with the terminal Wilson
  partition on the same history. These corrections were sent to the author.

