  <section|Elementary leaf transfer and projection
  allowance><label|elementary-leaf-transfer-and-projection-allowance>

  Reviewed parent leaf-transfer.tex at final SHA-256
  <verbatim|e7234ac0f3ce52aa92ebcd456ccaadfbce2f4f4c63ce2f423211cb5a311ad62a>.
