  <section|Free polar-vector classification \V held for substantive
  repairs><label|free-polar-vector-classification--held-for-substantive-repairs>

  Limits TeX <verbatim|b7f4795fff46e0f3e52d0753f782113a229558253236c4d013c5629fe6f53172>,
  evidence <verbatim|26e105b0089aa6fa6e4971e96ee4607ba97426741e8b3afd31f6f41a4aac782f>.
