  automatic analytic obstruction. Bounded narrowed verdict carries.
  Fingerprints and targeted whitespace check verified.

  Final parent selected-course editorial carry: complete diffs against author
  cf1708b8/0f71d8ca show only the plateau display split into two gathered
  rows and manifest path corrected to source/upstream.json. Verified that
  this manifest exists and Lean/source/upstream.json does not. Parent TeX
  <verbatim|4e653d2415ae0f160a865ec3af41aedb92358940dde19319308fead739f2d102>,
  evidence <verbatim|8032f2f75ab52009de515bd2b1e37f9709d6fd80d7af3a431a2128ed2f6921da>;
  narrowed bounded pass carries unchanged. Review work now frozen for parent
  packaging; no further mathematical expansion initiated.

